Autopsy 4.22.1	-	Used to examine the Washer.E01 image, identify user activity, deleted files, and suspicious files.
Exterro FTK Imager - Used to verify the MD5 hash of the Washer.E01 image to ensure nothing had been changed from the time of acquisition.
Windows Notepad	-	Used to document the investigative process and flags found.
Snipping Tool	- Used to capture screenshots of flags and evidence important to examination.
